        "kind": "definition",
        "domain": "physics",
        "title": "Isolated compound and feasible equilibrium set",
        "statement": "Define a finite compound endpoint product and the explicit feasible subset fixed by totals, permitted exchanges and retained partitions; the definition assumes no nonemptiness, compactness, convexity or attainment.",
